#
# Demux unit tests (WI-1.230, WI-1.231; same override as core/tests/bitreader, WI-1.102). Catch2's CHECK/REQUIRE
# macros expand to branches, so a table-driven test case trips readability-function-cognitive-complexity on code
# that has almost no control flow of its own. Count only the test's own branches.
InheritParentConfig: true
CheckOptions:
  readability-function-cognitive-complexity.IgnoreMacros: true
